EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Arizona State University.

Letters of recommendation are not required, or accepted, for a general university admission application. If a student is interested in applying to Barrett, The Honors College, they must complete an additional Barrett application, where letters of recommendation will be needed. For your convenience, I have included the link to Barrett, The Honors College: https://barretthonors.asu.edu/.

Please let me know if you have other questions.

{!User.FirstName} {!User.LastName}
{!User.Title}
Admission Services

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
